      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أجّج النَّارَ</span></b> , (S, A, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَأْجِيحٌ</span>, (K,)
<i>He made the fire to</i> [<i>burn, burn up, burn brightly</i>
or <i>fiercely,</i> (see 1,)] <i>blaze,</i> or <i>flame,</i> or <i>blaze</i>
or <i>flame fiercely.</i> (S, A, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أجّج</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَهُمْ شَرَّا</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>He kindled evil,</i> or <i>mischief, among
them.</i> (TA.)

